cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "SpectraView"
abstract: >-
  A desktop spectroscopy viewer and processor with companion widgets for
  Orange Data Mining, designed for teaching and research in food analysis
  and instrumental analysis. Loads, overlays, converts and pre-processes
  FTIR, Raman, UV-Vis, NIR and XRF/LIBS spectra; the orange-spectra add-on
  provides URL import from public databases (IRUG, SOPRANO), similarity
  search, spectral libraries (.speclib), NNLS mixture analysis, and a
  webcam-spectrometer image-to-spectrum widget with wavelength calibration.
authors:
